{"name":"Blue Astro","hex":"#50a7d9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"},{"term":"astro","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Clipping of astrology.","Clipping of astroturf."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/astro"}],"entries":[{"title":"Astro (South Korean band)","blocks":[{"text":"Astro is a South Korean boy band formed by Fantagio. The group is composed of four members: MJ, Jinjin, Cha Eun-woo, and Yoon San-ha. Astro was originally a sextet; Rocky departed from the group on February 28, 2023, and Moonbin died on April 19, 2023. They debuted on February 23, 2016, with the extended play Spring Up and were subsequently named as one of the best new K-pop acts of 2016 by Billboard."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Astro_in_Sept_2017_%28derived%29.jpg/330px-Astro_in_Sept_2017_%28derived%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astro_(South_Korean_band)","wikidata":"Q23004252"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png/500px-Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png/500px-Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Astro at their showcase for Dream Part.01","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAstro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg/500px-Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg/1280px-Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg/500px-Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"From left to right: Moonbin, Jinjin, Rocky, and Sanha at the HallyuPopFest 2022 in London","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAstro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/2